"    \"nep_path\": \"path/to/nep.txt\",\n"
"    \"n_samples\": 100,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.01,\n"
"    \"backend\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"chunk_max_atoms\": 100000,\n"
"    \"strategy\": \"global\",\n"
"    \"existing_dataset_path\": \"\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:109
#: 9e1d4481214547eb8806cf214d6df59d
msgid "多元素集合平衡采样"
msgstr "Balanced sampling across element sets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:110
#: b38c725a1a064a16b271ef0dec5b77c1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"FPSFilterDataCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"nep_path\": \"path/to/nep.txt\",\n"
"    \"n_samples\": 330,\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.01,\n"
"    \"backend\": \"auto\",\n"
"    \"chunk_max_atoms\": 100000,\n"
"    \"strategy\": \"element_set\",\n"
"    \"existing_dataset_path\": \"path/to/train.xyz\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:126
#: 01b7283e74a947abb07888a12b8ac579
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:128
#: 5f63eab2f3914841a72fd283c8d54e10
msgid "任意生成链 → `NEP Dataset Display` 清洗 → `FPS Filter`：先去掉明显坏结构，再做代表性筛选"
msgstr ""
"Any generation chain -> clean in `NEP Dataset Display` -> `FPS Filter`: "
"remove invalid geometry before representative sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:129
#: 869b83f366a244c2be10842d3171c466
msgid "`FPS Filter` → 导出 DFT 计算：控制进入 DFT 计算的结构数量，节省计算资源"
msgstr "`FPS Filter` -> DFT export: bound the number of expensive labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:130
#: a83738135c4343529c6665d1c0afcc7c
msgid "多分支汇总后 → `FPS Filter`：先汇总各分支输出，再统一挑选"
msgstr ""
"Merged branch outputs -> `FPS Filter`: select across all branches "
"consistently"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:132
#: 6a1ec7bcbbe14e4f9982c6e25c465b4e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:134
#: 0d7c2937acba445c88dda134d03754bb
msgid "**卡片报错\"NEP file does not exist\"。** `nep_path` 指向的文件不存在。确认路径正确。"
msgstr ""
"**`NEP file does not exist`.** Correct `nep_path` to an existing model "
"file."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:136
#: 64b48ab0ea694d2687075565b7f67659
msgid ""
"**输出数量远小于 `num_condition`。** `min_distance_condition` "
"太严，无法选出足够多满足距离约束的结构。降低该阈值。"
msgstr ""
"**Output is far below `num_condition`.** `min_distance_condition` is too "
"strict; lower it to allow more selections."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:138
#: 40a4a37e207045edbdf64bca2d468263
msgid "**平衡模式提示目标数量不足。** `n_samples` 小于元素集合组数。提高目标数量，或者在上游移除本轮不需要的化学体系。"
msgstr "**Balanced mode reports an insufficient target count.** `n_samples` is smaller than the number of element-set groups. Increase the target or remove chemical systems that are not needed in this run upstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:140
#: 85163c902a614501a86cefd3a78aca9e
msgid ""
"**已有训练集没有改变结果。** warm start 只比较元素集合相同的结构。检查候选池与已有训练集的元素集合是否一致，并确认所用 NEP "
"模型支持这些元素。"
msgstr "**The existing training set does not change the result.** The warm start compares only structures with matching element sets. Check that the candidate pool and existing training set use consistent element sets and that the NEP model supports those elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:142
#: cabd2c4f49334172aeca9b213be44145
msgid "**挑出的结构覆盖不全。** FPS 只能从现有池里选。如果某些局域环境在输入池里本来就没有，FPS 也无法补充。回到上游增加生成多样性。"
msgstr ""
"**Coverage remains incomplete.** FPS cannot create absent environments. "
"Add the missing diversity upstream."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:144
#: 707f7946d48342b080acd46b88788b9d
msgid "**描述符计算很慢。** 大批量（>5000）时描述符计算可能耗时。先用 `FPS Filter` 之前控制好上游输出量。"
msgstr ""
"**Descriptor calculation is slow.** Pools above several thousand "
"structures can be expensive. Bound upstream generation and tune batch "
"size before sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:146
#: cead5fc7d4fc4344bdf6ebc0d5c7be91
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:148
#: 9da1de09275a45cfbabb962acbb4b546
msgid "不新增专用 Config_type 标签。输出结构保留原标签。"
msgstr ""
"No dedicated `Config_type` is added; selected structures preserve their "
"existing labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:150
#: 41212fac47cd424bbe66a95267edd4bd
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:152
#: 0cf518ec1ae84aca93c4e3a0834b2d7d
msgid ""
"无随机性。同参数同输入会得到一致输出。`global` 模式保留原有索引 0 起点，因此改变输入顺序可能改变选择；`element_set` "
"从各组描述符中心开始，对输入顺序更稳定。特征完全相同的近重复结构仍可能互换原始索引，但覆盖等价。"
msgstr "There is no randomness: identical inputs and parameters produce identical output. `global` retains the original index-0 starting point, so reordering the input may change the selection; `element_set` starts from each group descriptor center and is more stable to input order. Near-duplicate structures with identical features may exchange original indices, but their coverage is equivalent."

#~ msgid "Batch Size（batch_size）"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 1000。描述符批处理大小，只影响吞吐和内存。GPU 或大体系可以调大加速，内存紧张时适当调小。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `1000`. Descriptor batch "
#~ "size; affects throughput and memory "
#~ "only. Increase when the backend and "
#~ "memory allow, and reduce under memory"
#~ " pressure."

